  "question": "Where can I find a nature reserve that lie within 160 kilometers toward the east side of ABQ BioPark (Botanic Garden), Albuquerque, NM?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.680854 35.09327)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.680854 35.09327)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
